WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.739
Namaste. Is video mein teen cheezein.

00:00:02.739 --> 00:00:08.663
Pehla, Plan and billing: aapke plan mein kya hai, aur kya upgrade se khulta hai.

00:00:08.663 --> 00:00:13.993
Doosra, aaj ke daam: ek hi screen par kai item ke daam ek saath badalna.

00:00:13.993 --> 00:00:20.435
Aur teesra, koi dikkat ho to support request kaise bhejein aur uska haal kaise dekhein.

00:00:20.435 --> 00:00:24.211
Ye hardware ka public demo hai, abhi Free plan par.

00:00:24.585 --> 00:00:28.145
Menu mein Plan and billing. Upar aapka plan, Free.

00:00:28.145 --> 00:00:35.335
Is mahine kitni sale hui aur limit kitni, kitne item aur kitne login. Free hamesha ke liye aapka hai.

00:00:35.335 --> 00:00:41.956
In your plan mein jo kaam chalu hain, aur Unlock with an upgrade mein jo upgrade se khulenge.

00:00:42.336 --> 00:00:48.068
Neeche teeno plan: Basic, Pro aur Pro plus. Saal ka daam, ya mahine ka.

00:00:48.068 --> 00:00:52.428
Har plan mein pichhle plan ka sab kuch, aur naye kaam.

00:00:52.428 --> 00:01:01.067
Upgrade dabane par WhatsApp par hamari team se baat hoti hai, UPI ya bank se paisa, aur usi din plan chalu.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:11.891
Compare plans mein ek hi table: kitni sale, kitne item, kitne login, kitni branch, aur kaunsa kaam kis plan mein.

00:01:12.271 --> 00:01:22.242
More menu mein jo kaam aapke plan mein nahi hai, uske aage taala aur plan ka naam. Jaise Quotations, Basic ka.

00:01:22.621 --> 00:01:30.159
Taale wala kaam kholo to ye screen: ye kaam kis plan mein aata hai, uska daam, aur Upgrade ka button.

00:01:30.159 --> 00:01:33.592
Compare all plans se saare plan dekh sakte ho.

00:01:33.964 --> 00:01:38.711
Aur ek zaroori baat. Plan khatam ho jaaye to dukaan band nahi hoti.

00:01:38.711 --> 00:01:44.804
Dukaan Free par aa jaati hai, billing chalti rehti hai, aur saara data safe rehta hai.

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:46.575
Renew karte hi sab wapas.

00:01:46.987 --> 00:01:54.039
Ab aaj ke daam. Ye demo wapas poore plan par. Products mein Update today's prices.

00:01:54.039 --> 00:02:02.038
Saare item ek screen par, daam aur offer daam ke saath. Category chuno, Fasteners and Cement.

00:02:02.416 --> 00:02:10.292
Cement ka rate do pratishat badha. Plus do likho aur Apply: dikhe hue sab item ek saath badal gaye.

00:02:10.292 --> 00:02:14.907
Koi ek daam haath se bhi badal sakte ho. Galti ho to Undo.

00:02:15.279 --> 00:02:21.250
Save dabate hi naye daam save, aur billing mein turant naye daam lagte hain.

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:28.517
Koi dikkat ho, ya naya kaam chahiye? Menu mein Help. Upar aapke business ke sawal-jawab.

00:02:28.517 --> 00:02:34.925
Neeche Contact us: kis baare mein hai, jaise Feature request, aur apni baat likho.

00:02:34.925 --> 00:02:42.739
Send dabate hi aapko SR number milta hai, aur request hamari team ke phone par turant pahunchti hai.

00:02:42.739 --> 00:02:44.771
Demo mein bhejna band hai.

00:02:45.143 --> 00:02:51.595
Neeche Your requests: har request aur uska haal. Received, Being worked on, ya Resolved.

00:02:51.595 --> 00:02:59.514
Hamari team jaise hi kaam aage badhati hai, yahan dikh jaata hai. Baar-baar phone karke poochhna nahi padta.

00:02:59.896 --> 00:03:11.613
To aaj humne dekha: plan mein kya hai aur upgrade kaise, taale wala kaam, aaj ke daam ek saath badalna, aur support request ka SR number aur uska haal.

00:03:11.613 --> 00:03:12.467
Dhanyavaad.
